{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1765843200, "end_date": 1766534399, "month_true_total": 98, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:02:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "214018721", "author": {"steamid": "76561199188491196", "personaname": "Dark", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199188491196/", "num_games_owned": 82, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 1986, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1025, "last_played": 1775291929, "avatar": "d00f553cac5675926d1e1a8c47e474363ce82cc0"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is great, the EA launcher is terrible.", "timestamp_created": 1766512929, "timestamp_updated": 1766512929, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.596649050712585449", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213934091", "author": {"steamid": "76561198264700810", "personaname": "Surelyonlymikey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198264700810/", "num_games_owned": 158, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 9922, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9905, "last_played": 1775995535, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Having perfected the game prior on release on my PS4, and having completed it mulitple times on PC, both modded and unmodded, Mass Effect Andromeda is still worth playing in 2025. \n\nDoes the story lack at times? Yes.\nCan the games lack of polish be a little frustrating? Yes.\n\nBut the gameplay, the art direction, the sound design, the voice acting and the potiential this game had at release was good, and it could have been great.\n\nBut on the basis of the game you get for the pice, I wouldnt suggest getting it at full price. Its often up to 80% off during steam sales, so wishlist it and wait until then. \n\nIf you enjoyed 1-3, you'll like Andromeda. \n\nIf you've never played Mass Effect before, start here. Its the most approachable gameplay wise. \n\n", "timestamp_created": 1766427453, "timestamp_updated": 1766427453, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213879841", "author": {"steamid": "76561199078179906", "personaname": "youraveragepal", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199078179906/", "num_games_owned": 56, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8118, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5859, "last_played": 1767378698, "avatar": "434be0645a833db19f3bf6ff6bb3ac1104bcfee1"}, "language": "english", "review": "liberal nepo baby colonizer simulator 3000", "timestamp_created": 1766369970, "timestamp_updated": 1766369970, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523418188095092773", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213869944", "author": {"steamid": "76561198098001984", "personaname": "TheRealFodder", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198098001984/", "num_games_owned": 2225, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 181, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 67, "last_played": 1766621277, "avatar": "b07e5626d8ef23ec396b1f51b6e216bb204a0d41"}, "language": "english", "review": "The big negative with this game is that it's got Mass Effect in the title. Some people have strong emotions connected with that franchise and the change of tone would have quite rightly been quite jarring, off-putting and probably majorly disappointing.\n\nI never got into ME originally so the stripped-back, shooty-shooty bang-bang gameplay with RPG-lite bits glued on was absolutely fine with me. I've played about 30 hours on the Xbox One VCR and picked up the PC version on sale to see it running more than 25FPS...\n\nTaken as a standalone arcade adventure with a neat backstory a la Gears of War etc. - this is a fun time.", "timestamp_created": 1766359250, "timestamp_updated": 1766359250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213865671", "author": {"steamid": "76561198171372202", "personaname": "Lobot", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lobot090/", "num_games_owned": 271, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5630, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5630, "last_played": 1766355322, "avatar": "898364bffbb53ee4ead201ad96c73137ab864340"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overhated game... Still love to play it!", "timestamp_created": 1766355400, "timestamp_updated": 1766355400, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}